-- =====================================================================
-- AEGIS-EBS demo seed dataset. Apply ONCE after 001_base_schema.sql and
-- 002_showcase_expansion.sql (MigrationRunner order). Plain INSERTs:
-- re-running on a seeded DB fails on PRIMARY KEY/UNIQUE by design.
-- No transaction statements here: MigrationRunner wraps each script in
-- BEGIN IMMEDIATE itself; FK enforcement comes from PRAGMA foreign_keys=ON
-- in 001/002 and Db.open().
--
-- Contents: 1 building (B01), 10 floors, 4 zones/floor (F01-A..F10-D),
-- 120 devices (3/zone) + zone_devices, 4 demo users + role_grants,
-- FIRE/DRILL alert_templates with vi/en locales, FIRE_DRILL demo scenario.
-- All ids are deterministic UUIDv5; timestamps are UTC ISO-8601 (...Z).
--
-- SECURITY NOTE: every password_hash / credential_hash below is an
-- explicit PLACEHOLDER, not a real Argon2id hash and not a real secret.
-- Demo logins/device auth will fail until they are replaced with hashes
-- produced by PasswordHasher. Never commit real credentials to this file.
-- =====================================================================

